# FrameForge global rules

- Follow Phases → Steps in `docs/PHASES.md`. Never jump ahead.
- After every step: real tests to 100%, then commit and push `main` to TheSeeker713/FrameForge.
- Prefer simplicity. No Electron. CustomTkinter GUI.
- All user media under `%USERPROFILE%\Downloads\FrameForge\`.
- **Sequential downloads only** — never more than one active download job.
- SQLite WAL queue for persistence; prove with on-disk DB + restart tests.
- Preserve original audio on upscales; keep metadata when possible.
- Do not pollute C: with models/temp; use FrameForge output root.
